{"version":1,"content":"<p>早前 AMD 顯卡驅動程序被發現存在某種故障，該故障導致設備在空閒時驅動程序持續在後台進行寫盤。高速寫盤會持續消耗固態硬盤壽命，所以在收到反饋後 AMD 很快便發佈新版顯卡驅動程序修復問題。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587064.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:44:08.561601+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T03:24:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:37:19.272264+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:37:19.272264+00:00","content_hash":"a24a3fa22fb9be6c7ca5d403bb255a6e8decfc7831f290f23043c6644c0385b9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}